   "t": "В смысле?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What do you mean?' This short two-word phrase is the everyday Russian way to ask 'what do you mean?'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "В прямом смысле.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
