   "t": "'Timur brings us cognac.' He names the supplier who offered them cheap alcohol.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Пять литров коньяка каждую неделю.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
